      "q": "4. knows more about animals than the local veterinarians.\nII. Fill in the blanks by choosing the suitable option given in the brackets.\nDoctor Dolittle reacts to Polynesia’s information about animal languages with both excitement and ________ (certainty/curiosity). He rushes to ________ (write/ memorise) the bird words she provides and is interested in learning more.",
