      "a": "wer:\nThe actions that show polite behaviour towards guests at home are:\nOffering them a glass of water.\nAsking how they are doing.\nWalking with them to the door when they leave.\nThese statements reflect courtesy towards guests:\nServing the guests a glass of water.\nChecking on their well-being.\nSeeing them off at the door.\nPolite behaviour towards guests includes:\nGiving them water to drink.\nInquiring about their health and comfort.\nEscorting them to the door as they depart.\nIII. Sometimes you find that a few friends in class are rude while disagreeing with each other on certain issues. Work in groups. How would you deal with such a situation? Share at least three ways in which you can do this.\nAnswer:"
