      "q": "6. lading\n(ii) emptying\nPaper Boats Question Answer Class 7 – Let us listen (Pages 114—115)\nYou will listen to a conversation be¬tween a girl and her father about the art of paper folding called origami. As you listen, select the true statements from 1-7. (Transcript for the teacher on page 137 of the NCERT Textbook)",
