      "q": "8. The children screamed with joy (Main clause) as the waves rushed to the shore.\nClass 7 English Chapter 13 Question Answer – Let us listen (Pages 196-197)\nYou will listen to a girl speak about why she wishes to join the Armed Forces when she grows up. As you listen, answer the questions given below in two-three exact words you hear. (Transcript for the teacher on pg. 223)\nQuestion 1. What type of job does Gunjan think the Armed Forces is?",
